- Power_Usage: Abnormal power usage (either too high or too low) can indicate malfunction, increasing failure risk. Normal power usage suggests stable operation.
- Humidity: High humidity can cause corrosion or electrical issues, increasing failure risk. Low to moderate humidity is safer.
